  "post_content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; float: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">La &lsquo;Casa de les Mestres&#39;&nbsp;de Suera compta des daquest dijous amb dos noves plantes utilitzables i un ascensor, gr&agrave;cies a la inversi&oacute; de 63.446,07 euros que ha realitzat amb les ajudes del Pla 135 de la Diputaci&oacute; de Castell&oacute;, segons destaca una nota de la instituci&oacute; provincial. </span></span></p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sueracasadelesmestresinauguracio/img_0629.jpg\" alt=\"img_0629\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sueracasadelesmestresinauguracio/img_0630.jpg\" alt=\"img_0630\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sueracasadelesmestresinauguracio/img_0631.jpg\" alt=\"img_0631\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sueracasadelesmestresinauguracio/img_0632.jpg\" alt=\"img_0632\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sueracasadelesmestresinauguracio/img_0633.jpg\" alt=\"img_0633\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sueracasadelesmestresinauguracio/img_0635.jpg\" alt=\"img_0635\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sueracasadelesmestresinauguracio/img_0636.jpg\" alt=\"img_0636\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\"